      "category": "update",
      "title": {
        "en": "Welcome to the new Hemisphere Launcher",
        "fr": "Bienvenue dans le nouveau launcher Hemisphere"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "One click and you're on Hemisphere: Minecraft, Fabric, Java and our performance mods are installed and kept up to date for you.\n\nPick your optional mods in the Mods tab, and use Settings → Installation → Repair if anything ever goes wrong.",
        "fr": "Un clic et tu es sur Hemisphere : Minecraft, Fabric, Java et nos mods de performance sont installés et tenus à jour pour toi.\n\nChoisis tes mods optionnels dans l'onglet Mods, et utilise Paramètres → Installation → Réparer en cas de souci."
      },
      "link": {
        "label": {
          "en": "Join the Discord",
          "fr": "Rejoindre le Discord"
        },
        "url": "https://discord.gg/m3FGGUF"
      },
